{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't Mind the Robots</i> is a classic tower defense game in which you build a maze of towers to extend the path of enemy robots. Each new map presents a new challenge, requiring you to reevaluate your strategy and adapt to the approaching robots' strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/37f3583b4f0c260a3bcfcf4c928a52ad.poster.avif?t=1773567208\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/37f3583b4f0c260a3bcfcf4c928a52ad.webm?t=1773567208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/37f3583b4f0c260a3bcfcf4c928a52ad.mp4?t=1773567208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards and choose between numerous perks to improve your defense. Unlock new towers and build a deadly maze. Use support nodes, abilities, and aiming parameters to maximize the effectiveness of your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you prevail against increasingly powerful waves of robots?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/01e11c6e7e92acbd1916805432a5644a.poster.avif?t=1773567208\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/01e11c6e7e92acbd1916805432a5644a.webm?t=1773567208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/01e11c6e7e92acbd1916805432a5644a.mp4?t=1773567208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different towers with 3 upgrade levels each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ unique maps allowing several ways to victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 types of robots with individual strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perk system grants numerous improvements for towers, economy and intelligence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your towers' impact by placing support nodes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/171d95b8f34d49844aa12673dae3c3cb.poster.avif?t=1773567208\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/171d95b8f34d49844aa12673dae3c3cb.webm?t=1773567208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/171d95b8f34d49844aa12673dae3c3cb.mp4?t=1773567208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656070?t=1773567208","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/32143f1a757a94ecfcf07b406c08e9260a0cf1ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773567208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/b7a891cf511a7caecc52eac187349ad7cfc8da75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773567208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/b7a891cf511a7caecc52eac187349ad7cfc8da75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773567208","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"descriptio